network modeling, WTP and STP design, GIS integration, and environmental consulting. Each service is summarized with a brief description and a link to its dedicated detail page, helping prospective clients identify the right solution for their project needs.\",\n    \"file_name\": \"src/pages/Services.tsx\",\n    \"is_protected_page\": false,\n    \"navigation_note\": \"Accessible from the top navigation bar by clicking 'Services'. Also reachable from the homepage services overview section via 'Learn More' links and the hero CTA area.\",\n    \"sub_pages_required\": true,\n    \"list_of_sub_pages\": [\n      {\n        \"unique_page_id\": \"page_3_sub_1\",\n        \"page_name\": \"Hydraulic Network Modeling\",\n        \"description\": \"This dedicated service page explains Hydrologic Innovation's expertise in hydraulic network modeling using industry-leading tools like WaterGems and SewerGems. It details the methodology, use cases for urban water distribution and sewer analysis, deliverables, and client benefits including pressure optimization and leak detection capabilities.\",\n        \"file_name\": \"src/pages/HydraulicNetworkModeling.tsx\",\n        \"is_protected_page\": false,\n        \"navigation_note\": \"Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Hydraulic Network Modeling' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview.\",\n        \"sub_pages_required\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"unique_page_id\": \"page_3_sub_2\",\n        \"page_name\": \"Water Treatment Plant Design\",\n        \"description\": \"This service detail page covers Hydrologic Innovation's Water Treatment Plant design capabilities, outlining the engineering process from feasibility assessment through detailed design and compliance. It highlights design standards, technology integrations, past project scale, and the team's ability to deliver scalable, cost-effective WTP solutions for government and industrial clients.\",\n        \"file_name\": \"src/pages/WaterTreatmentPlantDesign.tsx\",\n        \"is_protected_page\": false,\n        \"navigation_note\": \"Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Water Treatment Plant Design' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview.\",\n        \"sub_pages_required\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"unique_page_id\": \"page_3_sub_3\",\n        \"page_name\": \"Sewage Treatment Plant Design\",\n        \"description\": \"This service detail page describes Hydrologic Innovation's Sewage Treatment Plant design services, covering biological treatment processes, environmental compliance, effluent quality standards, and integration with existing infrastructure. Clients learn how the firm handles complex STP projects from concept through commissioning for municipalities and industrial facilities.\",\n        \"file_name\": \"src/pages/SewageTreatmentPlantDesign.tsx\",\n        \"is_protected_page\": false,\n        \"navigation_note\": \"Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Sewage Treatment Plant Design' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview.\",\n        \"sub_pages_required\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"unique_page_id\": \"page_3_sub_4\",\n        \"page_name\": \"GIS Integration\",\n        \"description\": \"This service detail page explains how Hydrologic Innovation leverages Geographic Information Systems to map, analyze, and manage water and sewer networks spatially. It covers data capture workflows, integration with hydraulic models, asset management, and how GIS-driven insights support data-driven infrastructure planning for government and utility clients.\",\n        \"file_name\": \"src/pages/GISIntegration.tsx\",\n        \"is_protected_page\": false,\n        \"navigation_note\": \"Opens when a visitor clicks the 'GIS Integration' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview.\",\n        \"sub_pages_required\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"unique_page_id\": \"page_3_sub_5\",\n        \"page_name\": \"Environmental and Irrigation Consulting\",\n        \"description\": \"This service detail page covers Hydrologic Innovation's environmental impact assessment and irrigation system consulting offerings. It details how the firm applies hydrological modeling, sustainability frameworks, and precision irrigation design to serve agricultural clients, real estate developers, and government bodies managing water resources and land development projects.\",\n        \"file_name\": \"src/pages/EnvironmentalAndIrrigationConsulting.tsx\",\n        \"is_protected_page\": false,\n        \"navigation_note\": \"Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Environmental & Irrigation Consulting' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview.\",\n        \"sub_pages_required\": false\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"unique_page_id\": \"page_4\",\n    \"page_name\": \"Projects\",\n    \"description\": \"This page showcases Hydrologic Innovation's portfolio of completed and ongoing engineering projects presented in a case study format. Each project entry summarizes the client, sector, and challenge at a glance. Visitors — particularly government bodies and infrastructure companies — can browse work relevant to their own needs to build confidence in the firm's capabilities.\",\n    \"file_name\": \"src/pages/Projects.tsx\",\n    \"is_protected_page\": false,\n    \"navigation_note\": \"Accessible from the top navigation bar by clicking 'Projects'. Also reachable from the homepage credibility section and the footer navigation.\",\n    \"sub_pages_required\": true,\n    \"list_of_sub_pages\": [\n      {\n        \"unique_page_id\": \"page_4_sub_1\",\n        \"page_name\": \"Project Detail\",\n        \"description\": \"This page presents the full case study for a single project using the Problem → Solution → Result narrative structure. It includes project scope, tools and methodologies applied, measurable outcomes, client information, and visuals such as diagrams or GIS maps. This deep-dive view builds credibility with prospective clients evaluating the firm for similar infrastructure challenges.\",\n        \"file_name\": \"src/pages/ProjectDetail.tsx\",\n        \"is_protected_page\": false,\n        \"navigation_note\": \"Opens when a visitor clicks a project card or 'View Case Study' button on the Projects list page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Projects portfolio overview.\",\n        \"sub_pages_required\": false\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"unique_page_id\": \"page_5\",\n    \"page_name\": \"Technology\",\n    \"description\": \"This page highlights the advanced engineering tools and digital methodologies used by Hydrologic Innovation, including WaterGems, SewerGems, and GIS platforms. It explains the firm's digital twin approach to infrastructure modeling, demonstrating how simulation-driven design reduces risk, improves accuracy, and delivers better outcomes for complex water system projects.\",\n    \"file_name\": \"src/pages/Technology.tsx\",\n    \"is_protected_page\": false,\n    \"navigation_note\": \"Accessible from the top navigation bar by clicking 'Technology'. Also reachable from the homepage Tools/Technology section via a 'Learn More' link.\",\n    \"sub_pages_required\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"unique_page_id\": \"page_6\",\n    \"page_name\": \"Industries\",\n    \"description\": \"This page outlines the key industry sectors Hydrologic Innovation serves, including urban infrastructure, government projects, real estate development, industrial facilities, and agriculture. Each sector section describes the specific water engineering challenges faced and how the firm's services address those needs, helping visitors from each target audience quickly identify their fit.\",\n    \"file_name\": \"src/pages/Industries.tsx\",\n    \"is_protected_page\": false,\n    \"navigation_note\": \"Accessible from the top navigation bar by clicking 'Industries'. Also reachable from the homepage footer navigation and from relevant service detail pages via cross-links.\",\n    \"sub_pages_required\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"unique_page_id\": \"page_7\",\n    \"page_name\": \"Contact\",\n    \"description\": \"This page allows prospective clients to get in touch with Hydrologic Innovation through a structured inquiry form collecting Name, Email, Phone, and Project Details. A prominent 'Book a Consultation' CTA encourages qualified leads to schedule a call. The page also displays office location, email, and phone details to build trust and accessibility for government and corporate clients.\",\n    \"file_name\": \"src/pages/Contact.tsx\",\n    \"is_protected_page\": false,\n    \"navigation_note\": \"Accessible from the top navigation bar by clicking 'Contact'. Also reachable from the homepage hero CTA button 'Get Consultation', service detail page CTAs, and the footer 'Contact Us' link.\",\n    \"sub_pages_required\": false\n  }\n]"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9588,"cache_read_input_tokens":12047,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9588},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6db96559-5b58-4e95-a3fa-a5b4dd9b017f","uuid":"a5992f87-b395-4278-8de1-e39207daece3"}
