{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WR9LkmveqjjEVXyUk5sN3t","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Layout Details\n2\t\n3\t> Frontend layout spec. Covers only the app entry point and navigation layout. Individual page content lives in `ui_pages/{page_id}/page.json`.\n4\t\n5\t## Entry Point\n6\t- **Default First Page:** `Home` (`page_1`)\n7\t- **File:** `src/pages/Home.tsx`\n8\t- **Protected:** No (public)\n9\t- **How users reach it:** Default first page shown at the root '/' route. Entry point for all visitors. Also accessible by clicking the company logo in the top navigation bar.\n10\t\n11\t## Layout & Navigation\n12\t- **Menu Type:** `top_nav_bar` (public landing page with navigation in the top header)\n13\t\n14\t## Sub-Pages (Detail Views)\n15\t\n16\tThese pages are NOT in the navigation menu. They are reached from their parent page (e.g., clicking a table row, a button, or a card).\n17\t\n18\t| Sub-Page | Parent | Route Note |\n19\t|----------|--------|------------|\n20\t| `Hydraulic Network Modeling` (`page_3_sub_1`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Hydraulic Network Modeling' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n21\t| `Water Treatment Plant Design` (`page_3_sub_2`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Water Treatment Plant Design' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n22\t| `Sewage Treatment Plant Design` (`page_3_sub_3`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Sewage Treatment Plant Design' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n23\t| `GIS Integration` (`page_3_sub_4`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'GIS Integration' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n24\t| `Environmental and Irrigation Consulting` (`page_3_sub_5`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Environmental & Irrigation Consulting' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n25\t| `Project Detail` (`page_4_sub_1`) | `Projects` | Opens when a visitor clicks a project card or 'View Case Study' button on the Projects list page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Projects portfolio overview. |\n26\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"110cda41-9bd2-4c5b-9930-7f7a571d0fca","uuid":"3d4b311a-f4c4-4d8d-837b-ed880df49728","timestamp":"2026-04-18T17:08:29.308Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"planner/layout_details.md","content":"# Layout Details\n\n> Frontend layout spec. Covers only the app entry point and navigation layout. Individual page content lives in `ui_pages/{page_id}/page.json`.\n\n## Entry Point\n- **Default First Page:** `Home` (`page_1`)\n- **File:** `src/pages/Home.tsx`\n- **Protected:** No (public)\n- **How users reach it:** Default first page shown at the root '/' route. Entry point for all visitors. Also accessible by clicking the company logo in the top navigation bar.\n\n## Layout & Navigation\n- **Menu Type:** `top_nav_bar` (public landing page with navigation in the top header)\n\n## Sub-Pages (Detail Views)\n\nThese pages are NOT in the navigation menu. They are reached from their parent page (e.g., clicking a table row, a button, or a card).\n\n| Sub-Page | Parent | Route Note |\n|----------|--------|------------|\n| `Hydraulic Network Modeling` (`page_3_sub_1`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Hydraulic Network Modeling' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n| `Water Treatment Plant Design` (`page_3_sub_2`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Water Treatment Plant Design' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n| `Sewage Treatment Plant Design` (`page_3_sub_3`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Sewage Treatment Plant Design' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n| `GIS Integration` (`page_3_sub_4`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'GIS Integration' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n| `Environmental and Irrigation Consulting` (`page_3_sub_5`) | `Services` | Opens when a visitor clicks the 'Environmental & Irrigation Consulting' service card or link on the main Services page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Services overview. |\n| `Project Detail` (`page_4_sub_1`) | `Projects` | Opens when a visitor clicks a project card or 'View Case Study' button on the Projects list page. Back button or breadcrumb returns to the Projects portfolio overview. |\n","numLines":26,"startLine":1,"totalLines":26}}}
