ional',\n    sector: 'Real Estate',\n    project_type: 'WTP Design',\n    challenge_summary: 'Engineered a 12 MLD conventional water treatment plant with rapid mixing, flocculation, sedimentation, and dual-media filtration for a 15,000-unit mixed-use development.',\n    location: 'Austin, Texas, USA',\n    year: '2024',\n    thumbnail_url: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565514020179-026b92b2ec4a?w=600&h=400&fit=crop',\n    created_at: '2024-01-08T09:15:00Z',\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'proj-004',\n    title: 'Agricultural Irrigation System Modernization',\n    client: 'Central Valley Farm Cooperative',\n    sector: 'Agriculture',\n    project_type: 'Irrigation',\n    challenge_summary: 'Implemented precision drip irrigation backed by hydraulic modeling to reduce water consumption by 38% across 8,000 acres of high-value crop land.',\n    location: 'Fresno, California, USA',\n    year: '2023',\n    thumbnail_url: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?w=600&h=400&fit=crop',\n    created_at: '2023-08-22T11:45:00Z',\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'proj-005',\n    title: 'Municipal Stormwater GIS Mapping Project',\n    client: 'Seattle Public Utilities',\n    sector: 'Government',\n    project_type: 'GIS Integration',\n    challenge_summary: 'Digitized and integrated 1,100km of stormwater infrastructure into a centralized GIS platform enabling real-time asset management and flood prediction.',\n    location: 'Seattle, Washington, USA',\n    year: '2024',\n    thumbnail_url: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?w=600&h=400&fit=crop',\n    created_at: '2024-02-14T16:30:00Z',\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'proj-006',\n    title: 'Industrial Effluent Treatment System',\n    client: 'Nexus Pharmaceuticals Ltd.',\n    sector: 'Industrial',\n    project_type: 'STP Design',\n    challenge_summary: 'Designed a specialized pharmaceutical effluent treatment plant achieving 99.7% pollutant removal, enabling regulatory compliance and zero liquid discharge.',\n  